Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Analysis without competition", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.938153794974143*^9, 3.938153806124744*^9}, {
  3.9724579268037663`*^9, 
  3.972457978416902*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fbf1cb70-1f6d-4aa5-9659-\
3cc44b798117"],

Cell["\<\
When both parasitoids and competition are included, analytical treatment \
becomes intractable. Even determining the fixed points appears to be out of \
reach.
To gain insight into the effects of pest stage durations and juvenile \
parasitoids on parasitoid survival, we therefore consider a simplified \
version of the model without larval competition.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.972458054271632*^9, 3.972458230109681*^9}, {
  3.9724582680164843`*^9, 3.972458273925803*^9}, {3.972458308920944*^9, 
  3.972458358616825*^9}, {3.972458389974588*^9, 3.972458443367559*^9}, {
  3.972545446133355*^9, 3.972545512568968*^9}, {3.9850626943199863`*^9, 
  3.985062694619722*^9}, {3.985062777350801*^9, 
  3.985062788090434*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"58737e52-e142-4836-a25a-\
3920803a2967"],

