1ec5b6c1780b"],

Cell["\<\
The models are available in two versions: a fully developed version and a \
minimal version made possible by the formalism of DDEs\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.985063131102157*^9},ExpressionUUID->"601e206c-09eb-48b0-8222-\
b3f24d9f5ad3"],

