Cell["\<\
In the absence of competition among pests, only the intensity of the control \
exerted by the parasitoid can regulate the pest population.
Here, as dp>0, du>0, \[Tau]j>0 and a>0, the pest density at the non-trivial \
equilibrium is necessarily positive.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850720939628763`*^9, 
  3.985072176781311*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"683f30b8-ebe8-4d8f-8a30-\
c397020d3b83"]
}, Open  ]],

