Cell["\<\
We cannot solve this characteristic equation analytically to determine the \
stability of the non-trivial fixed points. However, we can search for \
parameter values at which the real part of the eigenvalues is zero, in order \
to identify the stability boundaries of the non-trivial fixed point.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.972527596925268*^9, 3.972527650124008*^9}, 
