Cell["\<\
In the absence of competition among pests, only the intensity of the control \
exerted by the parasitoid can regulate the pest population.
Here, as dp>0, dl>0, \[Tau]j>0 and a>0, the pest density at the non-trivial \
equilibrium is necessarily positive.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9850720939628763`*^9, 3.985072176781311*^9}, 
   3.9850731538125467`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"bfc8a413-5f35-45f4-8997-\
